  ..\.local\website-review\review.json and workstream 09. Parent visually inspected
  the final cream/dark contact sheet, desktop/mobile full pages and 200% order
  screenshot. Actual user visual approval remains separate.
- Cream/green recipe-book styling, the original story illustration, full uncropped
  sticker bounds and readable enlargement labels remain the direction. Final user
