  on the unchanged cream/green palette; workstream 12 records the measured bounds
  and actual desktop/mobile/identity review.
- 2026-10-04 - The user's explicit cursive/cute direction supersedes the earlier
  serif style. Workstream 10 records the implementation and local review;
  original cake pixels, simple navigation and all four sections remain.
- 2026-10-04 - Completed local sticker/story review: parent inspected the final
  contact sheet and actual desktop/mobile/200% order views; browser regressions
  passed. Workstream 09 is locally complete, not final user visual acceptance.
- 2026-10-04 - Restored the original story/note below the hero and removed photo-card
  rectangles/hero badge for the chosen white-contour cutouts. Navigation stays
  Home, View cakes and How to order. No new biography, FAQs, forms or extra custom
  section was added; new local visual review is in progress.
- 2026-10-04 - Removed story, FAQs, extra custom-cake marketing and form to prioritize
  the three requested sections. Inspected desktop/mobile layouts; real photos,
  cream/green styling and readable type remain intact.
- 2026-10-04 - Completed reference study and readability refinement. Kept cream/green
  and real photos; took clear browsing cues without adding commercial catalogue
  complexity or copying the reference brands/photographs. Workstream 08 owns the
  ongoing accessibility baseline; wholesale pink/arched redesign is not implied.
- 2026-10-04 - Implemented and visually reviewed the first local prototype.
  Adjusted the mobile contact bar so it does not cover hero or enquiry actions;
  strengthened form boundaries and dark-section focus contrast.
- 2026-10-04 - Initial plan written; actual prototype imagery is now available for
  conservative preparation before the visual composition is chosen.
